<title>SWEDEN: Stora says Q1 profit falls 54 pct.</title>
<headline>Stora says Q1 profit falls 54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group Stora said on Thursday that first quarter profit after net financial items fell 54 percent to 560 million crowns.</p>
<p>				  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   560  vs 1,215</p>
<p> Sales					10,682 vs 12,430</p>
<p> Earnings per share (crowns)	    1.15 vs 2.50</p>
<p> Operating costs			  9,079  vs 10,163</p>
<p> Depreciation				 920  vs    912</p>
<p> Share in associated companies	   42  vs	0</p>
<p> Operating profit			   725  vs  1,355</p>
<p> Net financial items			165  vs    140</p>
<p> Minorities			    CHARGE 6  vs	6 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					    185  vs    407</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
